1
00:00:01,041 --> 00:00:02,291
The Godfather…

2
00:00:04,041 --> 00:00:05,500
Yes, my lord.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,458
His healing is legendary.

4
00:00:07,458 --> 00:00:09,375
They say with nothing
more than a gesture,

5
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:11,875
he can pull a dying
man back from the brink.

6
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:13,375
Your illness would be...

7
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:14,666
trivial to him.

8
00:00:14,666 --> 00:00:16,625
But the Godfather disappeared years ago.

9
00:00:16,625 --> 00:00:18,666
How could we possibly find him?

10
00:00:19,375 --> 00:00:21,791
I know where he is.

11
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,666
What the hell
are you doing here?

12
00:00:31,666 --> 00:00:34,125
Last I checked, this
is still my home.

13
00:00:34,125 --> 00:00:35,791
Not your concern.

14
00:00:35,916 --> 00:00:38,125
You have no
right to be here!

15
00:00:38,125 --> 00:00:39,041
You were cast out.

16
00:00:39,041 --> 00:00:40,916
You're nothing to this family anymore!

17
00:00:40,916 --> 00:00:41,750
Get out!

18
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:42,625
Relax.

19
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:44,208
Worried I'm here to take back what's mine?

20
00:00:44,208 --> 00:00:45,416
You?

21
00:00:45,416 --> 00:00:49,291
A pathetic miner thinking
he can claim the title?

22
00:00:49,291 --> 00:00:50,958
In your dreams!

23
00:00:50,958 --> 00:00:52,500
Mother, don't say that.

24
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,750
Severin may spend his
days digging in dirt,

25
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,000
but he's still Carter blood.

26
00:00:56,666 --> 00:00:58,166
And now that Father's got sick,

27
00:00:58,166 --> 00:00:59,708
naturally he comes running back

28
00:00:59,708 --> 00:01:00,666
hoping for a share.

29
00:01:00,666 --> 00:01:01,333
I get it.

30
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:04,416
Can't blame him for being desperate.

31
00:01:04,416 --> 00:01:05,458
Miss this chance

32
00:01:05,458 --> 00:01:07,250
and he's stuck with a pickaxe for life.

33
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:08,583
You really think crawling back here for

34
00:01:08,583 --> 00:01:10,291
money changes anything about our wedding?

35
00:01:10,291 --> 00:01:11,416
Don't worry, Livia.

36
00:01:11,416 --> 00:01:13,416
We're still brothers, after all.

37
00:01:13,416 --> 00:01:15,125
If he can't afford
ord a proper wedding,

38
00:01:15,125 --> 00:01:16,500
I'll generously
give you one.

39
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:18,250
On the Carter name, of course.

40
00:01:18,250 --> 00:01:22,666
Same bloodline, yet you
turned out so pathetic.

41
00:01:22,666 --> 00:01:23,875
Idiots.

42
00:01:26,125 --> 00:01:28,333
What the freak did you say?

43
00:01:29,125 --> 00:01:30,166
That's enou-

44
00:01:30,958 --> 00:01:32,541
I'm not dead yet.

45
00:01:35,333 --> 00:01:37,708
You said you know
where the Godfather is?

46
00:01:37,708 --> 00:01:39,291
Tell me where he is.

47
00:01:39,291 --> 00:01:41,208
Bring the Godfather to me…

48
00:01:41,208 --> 00:01:44,708
and I'll allow you back into House Carter.

49
00:01:45,375 --> 00:01:47,375
I am...

50
00:01:48,458 --> 00:01:50,416
the Godfather.
